        <ExplanationTxt>INFORMATION DISCLOSED IN FORM 990 ARE PROVIDED BY MANAGEMENT OF FHCSD (THE SUPPORTED ENTITY). THE FORMS ARE SUBMITTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND MANANGEMENT FOR REVIEW. UPON FINAL APPROVAL, THE FORMS ARE FINALIZED AND SUBMITTED TO THE INTERNAL REVENUE SERVICE.</ExplanationTxt>
